        {
          "question": "e-12538",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Consider the linear transformation that acts on vectors in $\\mathbb{R}^2$ as follows (in the order given):\n\n- it rotates vectors by $90^\\circ$ clockwise about the origin, and then\n\n- stretches the result by a scale factor of $2$ in the $y$-direction.\n\nWhat is the image of the unit square shown below under the action of this linear transformation?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14062905/assets/e966d34d56ae25deb6bbf5849e813493c51730981031955e6833fd04d9ec1e2a.png)",
