        {
          "question": "e-12538",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "First, we apply the rotation of $90^\\circ$ clockwise:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14062905/assets/4da9df5bb1487aa693d9301c4a4901394da332197328637deef671a2bc59d204.png)\n\nThen, we apply the stretch by a scale factor of $2$ in the $y$-direction:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14062905/assets/f400e267f38f4624d64e3a1899f9bbed3ba69996f1cf846ccc59e06e9eb5f35e.png)",
